<div class="page-header"><h1>Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer in Washington</h1><p>Pinnacle Sales is the manufacturer's representative for Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets across Washington — recruiting and supporting kitchen & bath dealers from Seattle and the Eastside to Tacoma and Spokane, backed by 23+ years of in-market experience.</p></div>
