<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in Washington</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in Washington, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value for builder volume to handleless German luxury for the Eastside and waterfront. You get protected territory, in-person line training, design and quoting support, and showroom merchandising backed by 23+ years of dealer relationships across the Puget Sound region and beyond.</p>

