<h2 id="washington-market-opportunity">The Washington Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>Washington's kitchen market is led by the Puget Sound region — Seattle, Bellevue, and the Eastside tech corridor — with a strong remodel culture and high-end demand on Mercer Island and the waterfront. Kitchens here lean Pacific-Northwest contemporary: natural wood tones, warm neutrals, matte finishes, and clean lines that suit the region's modern and craftsman-influenced homes. Seattle's remodel market favors transitional-to-modern work with two-tone schemes and warm-wood islands, while the affluent Eastside — Bellevue, Kirkland, Mercer Island, backed by the tech economy — drives demand for sleek <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> and handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> kitchens — a high-margin opportunity for dealers carrying the right lines.</p>

<h2 id="dealer-support">Dealer Support That Drives Sales</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales backs Washington dealers with hands-on sales training, 2020/Winner design and quoting support, showroom display programs, factory coordination, and ongoing business development. We work alongside your team to move projects from concept to order.</p>

